{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想在 iPhone 上擁有完全配合自己打字習慣的鍵盤，VersaKey 正好切合這類需求。它適合經常輸入中英夾雜文字、符號或重音字元的用家，可自訂按鍵佈局、長按字元與數字列，並內置智能輸入輔助。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂按鍵與智能輸入</h2>\n<p>VersaKey 可重新對應字元、為長按指派自訂符號，並加減專用數字列，常用符號毋須切換版面即可取用。外觀備有多款可自訂主題。智能輸入具備自動更正、字詞完成與建議、下一個字詞預測及自動大寫，並以自適應觸控範圍補償輕微偏差的點按。程式另設短文練習與字詞操練，協助用家建立準確度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-450-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-451-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-452-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-453-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-454-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-455-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VersaKey</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T09:00:27.021664+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}